<p><em>&quot;To make an apple pie from scratch, you must first create the universe.&quot; &#8212; Carl Sagan.</em></p>
<p>This SCP was inspired by my love of Carl Sagan quotes and <em>Rick and Morty</em>'s disturbing cartoon insanity as seen in the Microverse Battery episode.</p>
<p>Thank you to darkgreeny, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1558990&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1572140796" alt="Leveritas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1558990)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;">Leveritas</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rigen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2826105); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2826105&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1572140796" alt="Rigen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2826105)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rigen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2826105); return false;">Rigen</a></span> for their feedback. <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirpudding" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(348648); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=348648&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1572140796" alt="sirpudding" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=348648)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirpudding" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(348648); return false;">sirpudding</a></span>, while I wish you would have said a little more about the draft, it was and always will be fun to hear about the eventual heat death of the expanding universe. :)</p>
